/* taxiing-who-gives-way-1-and-2 */
sec('Aerodromes','Right of way on the ground',[dzF('Taxiing: who gives way (1 and 2)','<g class="pdg"><rect x="10" y="8" width="300" height="24" rx="4" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1"/><text x="160" y="24" text-anchor="middle" class="d1">1. Whatever ATC says, avoiding a collision is up to you</text><rect x="10" y="40" width="145" height="150" rx="6" fill="var(--surface-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="18" y="54" class="d1">2. Landing traffic first</text><path d="M18 74H148V96H18Z" fill="var(--ink-2)"/><path d="M24 85H142" stroke="#fff" stroke-dasharray="6 5"/><path d="M80 96H100V176H80Z" fill="var(--ink-2)" opacity=".7"/><path d="M76 110H104" stroke="#f2c14a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="4 2"/><g transform="translate(42 85) rotate(90) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--accent)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><path d="M58.0 85.0L119.9 85.0" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/><path d="M128.0 85.0L119.9 81.4L119.9 88.6Z" fill="var(--accent)"/><g transform="translate(90 130) rotate(0) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--ink)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><text x="82" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="d2">landing or taking off</text><text x="108" y="128" class="d2">stop and</text><text x="108" y="138" class="d2">give way</text><rect x="165" y="40" width="145" height="150" rx="6" fill="var(--surface-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="173" y="54" class="d1">3. Head-on: both turn right</text><g transform="translate(200 120) rotate(90) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--ink)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g transform="translate(276 110) rotate(-90) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--ink)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><path d="M212 120Q236 122 248 150" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/><path d="M246.0 146.0L247.4 150.3" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/><path d="M250.0 158.0L250.9 149.2L244.0 151.5Z" fill="var(--bad)"/><path d="M264 110Q240 108 228 80" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/><path d="M230.0 84.0L228.6 79.7" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/><path d="M226.0 72.0L225.1 80.8L232.0 78.5Z" fill="var(--bad)"/></g>','Aircraft on the ground give way to aircraft taking off or landing. Head-on, or nearly so, each turns right.',320,198)]);
/* taxiing-who-gives-way-3-and-4 */
sec('Aerodromes','Right of way on the ground',[dzF('Taxiing: who gives way (3 and 4)','<g class="pdg"><rect x="10" y="8" width="145" height="180" rx="6" fill="var(--surface-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="18" y="22" class="d1">4. Converging</text><g transform="translate(116 64) rotate(-90) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--ink)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><path d="M102.0 64.0L37.8 64.0" stroke="var(--ink-2)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><path d="M30.0 64.0L37.8 67.5L37.8 60.5Z" fill="var(--ink-2)"/><text x="66" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="d2">has right of way</text><g transform="translate(40 160) rotate(0) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--accent)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><path d="M40 146Q42 98 100 98Q140 98 142 50" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/><path d="M142.0 54.0L142.0 48.1" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/><path d="M142.0 40.0L138.4 48.1L145.6 48.1Z" fill="var(--bad)"/><text x="54" y="166" class="d2">has it on its right:</text><text x="54" y="176" class="d2">stop or pass behind</text><rect x="165" y="8" width="145" height="180" rx="6" fill="var(--surface-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="173" y="22" class="d1">5. Overtaking</text><g transform="translate(240 70) rotate(-90) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--ink)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><path d="M226.0 70.0L187.8 70.0" stroke="var(--ink-2)" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><path d="M180.0 70.0L187.8 73.5L187.8 66.5Z" fill="var(--ink-2)"/><text x="240" y="50" text-anchor="middle" class="d2">being overtaken:</text><text x="240" y="60" text-anchor="middle" class="d2">has right of way</text><g transform="translate(292 150) rotate(-90) scale(1.1)"><path d="'+ACPATH+'" fill="var(--accent)" stroke="var(--surface)" stroke-width=".6" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><path d="M278 150Q250 150 240 120Q232 104 200 100" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="5 3"/><path d="M204.0 100.0L194.1 100.0" stroke="var(--bad)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/><path d="M186.0 100.0L194.1 103.6L194.1 96.4Z" fill="var(--bad)"/><text x="238" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="d2">overtaker keeps</text><text x="238" y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="d2">well clear until past</text></g>','The one with the other on its right gives way and must not cross ahead unless well clear. The aircraft being overtaken has right of way.',320,196)]);
